sequenceDiagram
    actor Editor
    actor Approver
    participant UI as Appsmith Admin
    participant CP as Control Plane Service
    participant Val as Validators / Adapter Registry
    participant Sim as Simulation Engine
    participant PG as PostgreSQL
    participant Services as Runtime Services

    Editor->>UI: edit ontology/goals/policies/templates
    UI->>CP: create/update draft
    CP->>PG: save immutable draft revision
    Editor->>UI: validate
    UI->>CP: validate draft
    CP->>Val: schema, graph, metric, strategy, security checks
    Val-->>CP: validation report
    CP-->>UI: errors/warnings
    Editor->>UI: simulate historical window
    UI->>CP: simulate(draft_id, window)
    CP->>Sim: compile temporary bundle and run
    Sim-->>CP: impact/diff report
    CP-->>UI: candidate/health/brief changes
    Editor->>UI: submit for approval
    Approver->>UI: approve
    UI->>CP: approve draft
    CP->>PG: record approval
    Approver->>UI: publish
    UI->>CP: publish effective version
    CP->>PG: atomically update runtime pointer + outbox
    CP-->>Services: ConfigPublished(version_id)
    Services->>CP: fetch immutable runtime bundle
